    You decide to move toward the east.
 
The barbarian attacks you with 270 units of power!
But you survive the attack!
As you move into the next room,
you see that you are in a stone cavern.
 
To the north is a granite wall.
To the south is a passage way.
To the east is a stone wall with a map on it.
To the west is a passage way.
 
At your feet you see a sharp lance.
In front of you is a barbarian warrior.
 
    You decide to move toward the east.
 
The barbarian attacks you with 310 units of power!
 
 
Oh, dear!
 
I'm afraid that my little pets would have
killed you had I not arrived at the last moment!
You really must be more careful!
 
But then you can't win them all, you know,
and this next dungeon of mine is so easy,
you can't lose!
Would you like to play again? You bet I do!
 
That's the spirit!
And this time we will try to make your stay
a bit more interesting! Ha, ha, ha!
 
